WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.250
I'm paralyzed!

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.710
At the mysterious banquet,

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.730
the so-called main course made of pigeon meat

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.840
is actually made of toxic true fog meat.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:47.480
Zhou Yu and I saw through it in time

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:49.500
and dodged a bullet,

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:50.770
but Meili...

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:55.900
It's been a long time, Zhou Yu.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.650
Who on earth are you?

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.940
The mysterious masked chef who claimed that

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:02.530
he wanted to take revenge on Zhou Yu

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:04.050
agreed to give us the antidote on the condition that

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.410
Zhou Yu took part in the Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.060
Use lobsters to compete against
each other for three rounds.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.270
However...

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:19.820
Zhou Yu.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.800
Hang in there, Chef Zhou Yu!

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.500
Scorpion.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.040
I've already succeeded to take revenge on him.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.820
It's all over now.

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:29.370
Wait a minute.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.400
Next, as the best student of Chef Zhou Yu

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:35.650
and,

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.580
as the Super Chef Liu Maoxing,
I'll compete with you!

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.140
This punk!

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:45.300
Inherited Spirit

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.740
Bloody Battle at the Western-style Mansion!!

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.790
What did you say, kid?

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.510
Say it again.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.080
I can say it again and again.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.000
I want to replace Zhou Yu

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.700
and complete the rest competition with you.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.240
Kid, are you insane?

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:14.690
Do you think you are qualified to be my opponent?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.060
Do you want to run away?

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.090
Nonsense.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.550
I don't have time to

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:20.340
play games with just a Super Chef.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:22.370
I will never forgive you.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.000
Although I don't know

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.220
what happened between Zhou Yu and you,

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.410
Yet you poisoned Meili.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.720
I won't forgive you!

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:31.490
I told you that

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.230
Zhou Yu also

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.510
used what you called despicable means

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.710
to win in a competition before.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:39.000
Besides, he took something more important than

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.470
my life away from me.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.780
It's reasonable for me to hate him.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.600
Meili is Zhou Yu's daughter.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:48.140
Just because of this,

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:49.780
I have every reason to poison her.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.520
You're totally irrelevant to us.

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:53.540
You came here without my invitation.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.830
My revenge plan is completed.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:57.830
You're not eligible

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.720
to criticize what I did.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:03.720
Kid!

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.210
Tell me! What's the theme of the second round?

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:23.630
Why did it suddenly start to rain outside?

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:31.260
I hate it.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.890
Mao, Meili

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.350
and Chef Zhou Yu.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.850
It seems that all of them have gone to

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.390
an interesting place.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.880
But why do I have to stay here

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.430
and wash plates alone?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.310
Crap. They left me alone here.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.900
What's wrong with them?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.000
It's a little bit scary.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:04.690
Who's there?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.360
How can anyone be there?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.380
Who... Who are you?

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.790
Why are you making noises alone here?

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:51.110
It's you, old man.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.690
Your name is Silang, right?

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.180
Gofer kid.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.120
Why do you call me gofer kid?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:56.840
Honestly!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.130
An old man shouldn't use these words.

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:02.040
Well, is Zhou Yu's ice sculpture

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.030
still outside?

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.310
Yes. It's so big.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.350
It's very troublesome to put it in the kitchen.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:09.660
Shoot!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:10.910
The rain will melt it!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:14.620
Crap!

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.110
Come here, old man!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.020
Help me now!

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:18.520
I can't move it alone.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:19.870
OK. Wait for me.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.110
It hurts so badly.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.250
It's so unlucky.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.510
Hope Zhou Yu and others

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.520
are still fine.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:47.630
Tell me. Time is running out.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.490
What on earth is the theme of

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.310
the second round of the Three-round Lobster Competition?

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.410
You're so annoying.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:56.280
I don't want to

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.380
compete with you.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:58.760
Crap.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:09.300
If he keeps putting me off,

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.410
Zhou Yu and Meili will...

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.240
Wait a minute! Hey!

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.410
We succeeded!

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:48.940
Anyway,

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.410
I have to continue with this competition.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.930
Because I'm the successor to
Chef Zhou Yu's cooking skills.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.560
If you don't defeat me,

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:19.690
your revenge plan cannot be considered a success.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.250
What did you say?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.510
What do you want to do, kid?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:33.230
As long as I open the eyes in my heart,

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:34.940
I also can succeed.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:44.570
What?

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:04.200
So fast.

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.470
OK. I'm done.

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:30.310
What do you think?

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:41.120
What he made is exactly the same as mine.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:42.640
He finished

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.570
the job left by Zhou Yu.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.630
Besides, when he blindfolded himself,

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:46.900
he could still cut them so perfectly.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:50.320
Looks like this kid

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:52.900
is not just an ordinary Super Chef.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.870
Tell me. What's the theme of the second round?

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:56.650
Well,

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.120
it seems that if I don't defeat you,

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.510
I can't say that

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.050
I've taken revenge on everything of Zhou Yu.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.070
Listen to me carefully, kid.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:07.130
The theme of the second round of
the Three-round Lobster Competition

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.020
is frying.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.680
Fry lobsters to decide the winner.

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:13.110
I got it.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.100
What's the condition?

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:15.910
Compare my speed with yours.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.300
When either of us finishes his work,

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:19.610
the other person has to stop.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:21.600
Then we'll taste each other's dish.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:23.720
OK.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.060
First, I'd like to announce that

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.030
maybe when you're heating the oil,

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.210
I've already made my dish.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.830
It's impossible for you to win.

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.110
What do you think?

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.920
Do you still want to compete with me, fledgling?

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:47.170
Is this all you want to say?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.000
Then I'd like to advise you to

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:52.960
make it as fast as you can.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.200
Otherwise, you can't win.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:57.980
You... What did you say?

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.030
Let's get started.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.200
Time is running out soon.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.000
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:22.390
I can't keep waiting anymore.

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:23.710
I remember Mao said

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:26.380
it's the Western-style Mansion
on the south side of Haizhong Park.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:41.400
Crap!

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.390
Looks like you're better than I thought, kid.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:06.920
Make it as fast as you can.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.830
Otherwise, you can't win.

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:10.190
What an arrogant kid!

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.870
But you'll regret

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:17.900
your bold provocation later.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.650
Idiot.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.340
The result is settled.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.490
I'll finish it as long as I make the sauce.

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:35.870
I only need less than one minute.

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:42.840
I'm done!

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:44.890
What?

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.330
No way!

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:52.850
How could you make it so fast?

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:55.430
Come on. Let's taste each other's dish.

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.310
Take out your dish.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.440
Listen to me carefully.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.300
My dish is the Fried Fantail Lobster.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.250
I covered lobsters with crushed nuts and fried them.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.470
After crushing the nuts,
cover the lobster meat with them.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.770
Fry them until they become golden.

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.080
Therefore, I need to consider how to balance

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.080
the outside nuts and the inside lobster meat.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:24.220
To adjust the oil temperature,
advanced cooking skills are needed.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:25.710
Yes,

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.130
this is a flawless first-class work.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.240
No, it's better than the first-class work.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:33.220
Frying the fresh, crispy and tasty

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:34.390
nut coating

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:35.780
can double its aroma immediately.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.230
It's so delicious.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.380
If you eat the lobster with a sauce,

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:40.940
the taste will be very wonderful.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:41.770
Sauce?

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:44.020
The essence of the fried lobsters

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.740
is the wonderful combination with the sauce.

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.430
That... Where is that sauce?

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.460
To make that sauce,

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.070
you need to cut up apples, onions

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.040
and the garlic first.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.510
Then blend them with

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.360
various seasonings in wonderful proportion.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.130
So I asked you where the sauce is.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.120
That...

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.650
That sauce.

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.980
Give me one minute. I can finish it.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:08.330
That means

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.460
you're not done.

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:12.830
It's unnecessary to

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.270
taste an unfinished dish.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.020
You're too arrogant!

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:20.280
Shut up! It's a competition.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.330
It's related to the life of Meili, Zhou Yu

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.740
and others.

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:26.210
It's a serious competition!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:30.080
Then what about your fried lobsters?

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:46.170
They're just like that?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:47.300
Yes.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:48.910
No kidding!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.190
How could you brag to me shamelessly?

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:52.870
Kid,

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:55.160
your dish is also unfinished.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.050
Crap.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:16.270
The Western-style Mansion
on the south side of Haizhong Park.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:17.100
Where is it?

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.480
I have no idea how I can get there.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.020
What's that?

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.450
Help!

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:57.860
It hurts so badly.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:06.710
It's here.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.600
It's not finished, kid.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:13.220
No, my dish is finished.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.040
Kid, you haven't figured it out yet, have you?

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:17.590
Listen.

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:19.760
Like I said just now,

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:20.750
the essence of the fried lobster

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.800
is the combination of
the attractive aromatic fried lobster

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.010
which has turned golden after being fried with hot oil

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:26.900
and the thick mellow sauce.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:30.790
How dare you say that
you're done without making a sauce?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:31.780
You're so funny.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.760
Who will agree with you?

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:36.980
By the way, look.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.490
The lobster is so ugly.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:40.570
You just threw an entire lobster

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.680
into the pot with oil and fired it.

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.470
Besides, even I

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.950
am in a hurry to fry lobsters in such a short time.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.440
How can a rookie like you

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.480
fry and make good lobsters?

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:59.000
How dare you let me play boring games with you.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.970
You even made my joy of defeating Zhou Yu

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.250
decrease.

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.670
You don't know anything.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.390
Tell me,

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.810
what don't I know?

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.790
Have a taste. Then you'll get it.

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:16.420
Come on. Have a taste now.

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:18.920
You'll know if your revenge plan is successful

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.680
after you have a taste.

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:22.500
Punk,

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.680
I don't think you can always be arrogant.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.330
Well, I'm gonna taste it.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:50.690
(Delicious)

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:53.300
How can it...

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:54.540
How can it be so delicious?

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.330
Is the

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.700
sauce inside?

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.710
To make this smooth and tasty sauce,

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.040
you blended yolks with oil first

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.340
and added milk and sugar later, right?

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.470
The nut coating is fragrant and crispy
after being fried.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.340
The perfect combination of

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.620
the sweet lobster meat and the tasty smooth sauce.

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.950
How did you make it?

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:30.770
If you pour the sauce into the coating,

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:33.820
the sauce will flow out when being fried.

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:40.770
This... This is...

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:42.210
Tofu skin.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:43.600
I think you also know that

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.110
it's a thin layer of skin

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:45.990
which forms on the liquid surface

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.550
during the boiling of soy milk
which is the raw material of tofu.

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:52.970
You used the tofu skin?

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:56.010
Yes.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.670
I put the tofu skin between the lobster meat

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:02.880
and the coating to seal the sauce.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.970
Because the tofu skin acts as a block,

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.050
the sauce cannot flow out

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:07.050
even if I fry the lobster.

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.350
The lobster covered by a layer of tofu skin

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:20.250
is called

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:23.490
Liu Maoxing's Special Cloudy Fried Lobster.

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.410
I already told you to

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:34.670
make it as fast as you can.

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:36.840
You little bastard.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:38.980
I was in such a hurry

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:40.520
Just to fry the lobsters,

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.310
but he did so many things in such a short time.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:46.630
What an incredible technique!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.200
What a terrifying talent!

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:51.680
On second thought.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:52.930
Except for Zhou Yu,

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.110
even those leaders of the Guangzhou Cooking Society

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.870
didn't realize that it was the toxic true fog meat.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.950
But he saw through it immediately.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:05.650
Besides, he became a Super Chef at such a young age.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.680
Looks like the student who has been

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:13.480
trained by Zhou Yu directly is so great.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.690
One day, he'll become

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.080
a huge dragon who can

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.370
summon the wind and the rain
in Chinese Cooking Society.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:36.280
Well, who's the winner

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:37.550
of this round?

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:42.620
I'm too careless, kid.

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:45.590
Looks like if I don't try my best to defeat you,

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.540
my revenge plan cannot be considered a success.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.210
Well, kid.

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:51.860
Listen to me carefully.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:55.180
The antidote for saving Zhou Yu and others is
in the right bottle.

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.300
However, in the left bottle,

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:58.820
there is a poison that can

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:00.500
kill an elephant with only a few drops.

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:03.700
In the Three-round Lobster Competition,

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:05.310
I've won a round and lost a round.

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:07.810
The result will come out after the third round.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.130
If you win,

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.570
you can take the antidote.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.650
But if you lose,

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.900
you'll have to drink this bottle of poison.

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.810
What do you think? Will you accept the challenge?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.160
Yes.

00:23:14.809 --> 00:23:16.811
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.687 --> 00:23:18.563
Three-round Lobster Competition.

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:20.026
This is the last contest.

00:23:20.026 --> 00:23:22.984
The masked chef's challenge was to make a pot dish.

00:23:22.984 --> 00:23:26.487
And that guy had a tremendous stash of ingredients.

00:23:26.487 --> 00:23:28.406
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.531 --> 00:23:30.116
The Greatest Trump Card!

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.243
The Mocking Joker

00:23:32.368 --> 00:23:33.578
It will definitely be interesting!
